FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

INTELLIGENCE OFFICER LENKA
(serious)
Three villages received orders bearing our seal. Two orders contradict each other; one is designed to provoke a firefight.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

COMMANDER SAVA
(measured)
We will not punish civilians for forged paperwork.

LENKA
(firm)
Inspect all three posts. Identify the authentic hostile transmitter and leave the volunteer station intact.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
